- Initial experimental gswitch 0.8.0 package for openSUSE Tumbleweed x86_64.
- Build from source with vendored Go dependencies.
- Include the systemd user service, udev rules, and GTK tray.
- Automatically select the newest reachable upstream release tag and derive the package version from it.
- Use a version-neutral vendor archive name.
